1	line	Player	Err.. ok. Well, I've been sent from the Wizards' Guild in Yanille. There's been an... incident... Do you have any body parts?
1	line	Mazion	How did you know! I found the most awful thing in my sandpit - a head!
1	line	Player	Ahhh good! I need to take it back to be buried!
1	line	Mazion	You're very strange, but if it means I get rid of the horrid thing...
1	cond	If the player doesn't have inventory space:
2	line	Mazion	Or I would if you had any room in your bag!
2	action	end
1	box	Mazion gives you the head.
1	action	end
